; Template: Manual Expense Entry
; Copy this template and fill in the values
;
; Instructions:
;   1. Replace DATE with YYYY-MM-DD
;   2. Replace PAYEE with the vendor name
;   3. Replace DESCRIPTION with what was purchased
;   4. Replace EXPENSE_ACCOUNT with the appropriate account from accounts.beancount
;   5. Replace AMOUNT with the dollar amount
;   6. Replace PAYMENT_ACCOUNT with how it was paid
;
; Common expense accounts:
;   Expenses:Infrastructure:Domain
;   Expenses:Infrastructure:Compute:Hetzner
;   Expenses:Infrastructure:Compute:HetznerBackups
;   Expenses:Infrastructure:Storage:R2
;   Expenses:Infrastructure:Email
;   Expenses:AI:Claude:Discovery
;   Expenses:AI:Claude:ScriptGeneration
;   Expenses:TTS:ElevenLabs:Standard
;   Expenses:TTS:ElevenLabs:Premium
;   Expenses:TTS:OpenAI:Standard
;   Expenses:Software:DevTools
;   Expenses:Software:Monitoring
;   Expenses:Admin:Legal
;
; Common payment accounts:
;   Assets:Current:Cash:Bank
;   Liabilities:AccountsPayable:Hetzner
;   Liabilities:AccountsPayable:Anthropic
;   Liabilities:AccountsPayable:ElevenLabs

; DATE * "PAYEE" "DESCRIPTION"
;   EXPENSE_ACCOUNT  AMOUNT USD
;   PAYMENT_ACCOUNT  -AMOUNT USD
